sequenceDiagram
  participant Author
  participant Editor
  participant Workspace
  participant Compiler
  Author->>Editor: Change source
  Editor->>Workspace: Request draft preview
  Workspace->>Compiler: Compile draft
  Compiler-->>Editor: Preview and diagnostics
  Author->>Editor: Save
  Editor->>Workspace: Save with base content
  alt Source has not changed
    Workspace-->>Editor: Saved source
  else Another writer changed the file
    Workspace-->>Editor: Conflict to resolve
  end
